    // DEAD, AND LEFT AT 1.51:1 DELIBERATELY — DO NOT "FIX" THE CONTRAST HERE.
    //
    // `colors-ui-border-secondary` is grey-600 `#3a3a3a`, which against this
    // bar's `#1b1b1b` measures 1.51:1: the worst ratio in the file, and the
    // obvious thing to bump when auditing the bar for legibility. It would be
    // a bump to nothing. Nothing renders `.whitespace-set`. The markup was
    // the Karax proc `editorWhitespaceOption`, deleted in `df4d3ef2f`, and it
    // was ALREADY dead before that commit — in `df4d3ef2f^` the proc appears
    // exactly once, at its own definition, with no call site anywhere. The
    // backing `whitespace` field and its `increaseWhitespaceWidth` /
    // `decreaseWhitespaceWidth` mutators (`types.nim`) are equally
    // unreachable; their only callers were the deleted handlers.
    //
    // So the ratio is a fact about a rule that has never met a pixel. Raising
    // it would make the bar no more legible and would cost a real design
    // token spent on a selector the app cannot produce — and would leave a
    // fixed number that reads, to the next auditor, as evidence the control
    // is live. The same is true of `.whitespace-change`, `.whitespace-label`
    // and `#file-info-status-editor-whitespace` below.
    //
    // The honest fix is deletion, and that is not smuggled in behind a
    // contrast report: the whitespace controls are a FEATURE question (should
    // the footer offer whitespace width at all), not a colour one. Until that
    // is answered, this stays as it is, documented rather than adjusted.
    // `footer-contrast-guard.spec.ts` records it in `UNREACHABLE_SELECTORS`
    // with this reason, and asserts against the frontend sources that it is
    // still unrendered — so if anyone ever wires it up, the guard fails and
    // sends them here instead of letting 1.51:1 ship to a user.
    .whitespace-set
      width: 10px
      float: left
      font-size: 7px
      color: colors-ui-border-secondary
      margin-top: 4px
      margin-bottom: 2px

    .whitespace-change
      height: 8px
      width: 10px
      cursor: pointer

      :hover
        color: colors-ui-text-primary-body

      i
        display: block !important

    .whitespace-label
      width: 80px
      float: left
      margin-left: 10px

    .status-buttons
      float: left
      margin-left: 2vw
      display: flex

    #file-info-status
      margin-left: 0.6em
      display: flex
      align-items: center
      gap: 0.6em

    #file-info-status-editor-whitespace
      margin-left: 2vw
      float: left
      width: 100px !important

    #operation-status
      float: left
      width: 200px
      // margin-left: 2vw
      white-space: nowrap
      color: colors-ui-text-success-primary
