    .status-right
      float: right
      width: auto
      display: flex
      padding-right: 8px
      // Let the location readout shrink so `.location-path`'s ellipsis can
      // engage: a flex item will not go below its min-content width unless
      // `min-width` is relaxed, and a `nowrap` path's min-content is the whole
      // path.
      min-width: 0
    // margin-right: 3vw

    // WHICH REVISION THIS PAGE IS, when the deployment declares one.
    //
    // Rendered only by a served build — `StatusBaseModel.buildLabel` is "" on
    // the desktop and the view emits no element at all — so this rule matches
    // nothing in Electron and the footer's box layout is untouched. It is the
    // one fact about the page a user cannot obtain from the page any other
    // way, so it is present rather than hidden, and quiet rather than loud:
    // `nowrap`, never a flex item that can push `.location-path` out of its
    // ellipsis. The full 40-hex identity is in its `title`.
    //
    // IT IS QUIET BY BEING SMALL AND UNEMPHASISED, NOT BY BEING FADED.
    // `opacity: 0.6` used to do the dimming, and it was the worst-contrast
    // element in the whole bar: measured on the live page it composited the
    // inherited black down to **1.14:1**, below even the 1.22:1 everything
    // else inherited. Now that the bar declares a colour the multiplier would
    // still take grey-300 down to roughly 2.9:1 — under the 4.5:1 this text
    // needs — so it is removed rather than retuned.
    //
    // Removed rather than replaced with a dimmer token, because there is no
    // dimmer one to replace it with: grey-300 is already the quietest step in
    // the ramp that clears 4.5:1 on this surface. An opacity multiplier is
    // also the wrong instrument for "quiet" — it makes the resulting contrast
    // a function of two values instead of one, so the token no longer tells
    // you what the user sees and the guard has to composite it back out.
    .build-identity
      display: inline-flex
      align-items: center
      flex: 0 0 auto
      white-space: nowrap
      margin-right: 8px
      cursor: default

